        "note": "The Solution copies verbatim the files Defs, Selection, Structure, CaseJ, Theorem1, Closure, Monotone and Main of LeanWowii/W213/, each from its namespace W213 line to its end, with every name moved under the prefix Palomar213, because those files do not use Lean's module system. The supplement was built with Lean v4.37.0-rc1 and a later Mathlib commit; the copied parts build unchanged on this package's Lean v4.35.0 and Mathlib v4.35.0. Bridge lemmas in the Solution relate the Challenge's definitions to the supplement's: the 2-domination numbers and the Hamiltonian paths agree, the Challenge's lower median (the middle term) equals the supplement's for every finite graph, and the Challenge's literal lower median equals it for even n and is at least it for every n (the two differ on the path with three vertices).",
